  "thag1.95:0.4": "5. Cakkhupālattheragāthā 95. ",
  "thag1.95:1.1": "‘‘Andhohaṃ hatanettosmi, ",
  "thag1.95:1.2": "kantāraddhānapakkhando ; ",
  "thag1.95:1.3": "Sayamānopi gacchissaṃ, ",
  "thag1.95:1.4": "na sahāyena pāpenā’’ti. … ",
  "thag1.95:1.5": "Cakkhupālo thero…. "
}
